<title>GREECE: NEW FTSE INDEX FOR ATHENS STOCK EXCHANGE IN MAY.</title>
<headline>NEW FTSE INDEX FOR ATHENS STOCK EXCHANGE IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A new share index for the Athens stock exchange is planned to be launched in May by FTSE International, said an ad in the Financial Times.</p>
<p>The new index, called FTSE/ASE, will be based on a basket of stocks representative of the Athens bourse's performance and will be suitable to support derivative trading in the future, it said.</p>
<p>&quot;The index has impeccable credentials. It has been developed by FTSE International and will be calculated by the Athens stock exchange,&quot; said the advertisement.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
